-- Row il-71. EXPECTED RED: two assertions that fail on purpose, one per item. Each says that the reference is complete as the instruments deposited here print it, and each is FALSE.
-- I1: paragraph (2) of section 11(ג), as the last instrument deposited here left it (SH 2632), contains the term that paragraph (4)'s pointer puts in marks.
--     False: the words of paragraph (2) as SH 2632 printed them do not contain it.
-- I2: every place where an instrument deposited here wrote the phrase P into the Law is followed by an instruction deposited here that replaces P at that place.
--     False: section 21 is (SH 2024 section 67); subsection 11(ה) is not: no instruction deposited here replaces P there.
-- The count, two, is declared in check.sh (expected_failed) and in encoding.json (expected_red). If a later instrument changes either, its assertion turns green and the declared count must go down with it.

